{
  "_README": [
    "SYNTHETIC DEMO DATA - NOT OBSERVED, NOT MEASURED, NOT FROM ANY API.",
    "",
    "Every number in this file was written by hand to exercise the FLARE flood",
    "pipeline in a specific way. None of it is a real observation of any river",
    "or any rainfall. It exists so the demo runs identically with no network",
    "and so unit tests have stable, controlled inputs.",
    "",
    "Live data is fetched by collectors/weather.py and collectors/flood.py and is",
    "never mixed with anything in this file. Any assessment built from these",
    "fixtures is tagged data_quality.origin = 'synthetic_demo' and",
    "data_quality.is_synthetic = true in the output contract.",
    "",
    "SCHEMA",
    "  rainfall_mm_per_hour: sparse [offset_hours_from_now, mm_per_hour] pairs.",
    "    Negative offsets are observed hours, positive offsets are forecast hours.",
    "    Hours not listed are 0.0 mm. The materialiser builds a 144-hour series",
    "    covering -72h to +71h.",
    "  discharge_daily: sparse [day_offset_from_today, river_discharge,",
    "    river_discharge_mean, river_discharge_max] rows. Negative day offsets are",
    "    observed days, 0 is today, positive offsets are forecast days. The",
    "    materialiser builds a 10-day series covering -7d to +2d.",
    "  omit_*: set true to leave the whole block out of the payload, which",
    "    exercises the pipeline's missing-data path."
  ],

